re different.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Listen to the audio. Click on the correct word to complete the sentence. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le13ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le13ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le13ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn6le13ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "Are men and women different? When they are born, boys and girls have identical brains. As they grow, the body produces hormones that cause men and women to develop distinctly. These hormones cause different brain development in men and women. As a result, men and women may tend to think differently.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn6le13ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "Some believe that the difference between men and women is millions of years old. Could, they wonder, men and women have evolved separately?\n<br>\nEarly man provided food for his family. He regularly found his prey in jungles and forests. He threw spears or shot arrows at moving animals. He had to be decisive and realistic.", "id": 2, "time": "18000"}, {"image": "engenn6le13ob02re2img03.jpg", "text": "Early woman guarded her children against danger. She carefully gathered small things like fruit, berries, or mushrooms. She had to know the difference between those that could be eaten and those that were poisonous. She was intuitive and creative. <br>These early men and women survived because they did these tasks well.\n<br><br>\nHave modern man and women followed these ancient patterns? Some would agree and many would disagree.", "id": 3, "time": "38800"}]}}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "static", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "<p>Why are men and women different? When they are born, boys and girls have identical brains. As they grow, the body produces hormones that cause men and women to develop distinctly. These hormones cause different brain development in men and women. As a result, men and women tend to think differently.</p><p>Another reason for the differences between men's and women's brains is millions of years old. Men and women have evolved separately. Early man's job was to provide food for his family. He regularly found his prey in jungles and forests. He threw spears or shooting arrows at moving animals. He had to be decisive and realistic.</p><p>Early woman's job was to guard her children against danger. She carefully gathered small things like fruit, berries, or mushrooms. She had to know the difference between those that could be eaten and those that were poisonous. She was intuitive and creative.  The ancestors of these early men and women have survived because they did these tasks well.</p>"}], "id": 2}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Gender Issues", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Men vs. Women", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Leisure Time > Invitation: Shoe Salesman Awards", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le13ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "identical", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the same", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  When they are born, boys and girls have identical brains. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le13ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about how men and women are the same or different.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hormone", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a natural product of the body that performs a function", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The body produces hormones that cause men and women to develop distinctly.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le13ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "brain", "type": "name"}, {"content": "The part of the body used for thinking", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: These hormones cause different brain development in men and women. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le13ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to tend to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be likely to", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: As a result, men and women tend to think differently.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le13ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "decisive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "able to make decisions quickly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Early man had to be decisive and realistic.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le13ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "intuitive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "able to make decisions using feelings", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Early woman was intuitive and creative.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le13ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Present Perfect vs. Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a finished action or event that is connected somehow to the present.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished action.  When you use the Present Perfect there is a connection between what happened in the past and now and you  use time markers like <span class=\"italic\">for, since and ever. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "  When you use the Simple Past the action began and finished in the past and you use time markers like<span class=\"italic\"> then, ago, yesterday, when I was\u2026 ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Adverbs of manner tell us how something happens. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Examples:<br /><ul>  \t<li>He regularly found his prey in jungles and forests.</li> \t<li>Have men and women evolved separately.</li></ul>   \t\t\t", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"italic\">-ly </span>to an adjective:<br /> <br /> Examples:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">regular ----> regularly</span><br /><br />  You take out the letter<span class=\"italic\"> -y </span>and add <span class=\"italic\">-ily</span> to adjectives ending in<span class=\"italic\"> -y</span>.<br /><br />  Example:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">happy ---->happily</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The adjectives <span class=\"italic\">fast, hard, well </span>and <span class=\"italic\">straight</span> are exceptions. They do not change when they become adverbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"separate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"separately\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"different\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"differently\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"distinct\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"distinctly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"careful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"carefully\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"regular\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"regularly\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find the name of the book that is mentioned in this lesson.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online. Find 5 other books in English about the differences between men and women.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write the title and the author of each book.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read a description of each book.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose 1 book you would like to read.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe the book to your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain why you would like to read that book.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a bibliography of 6 books.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I choose 1 book to read.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe the book.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I explain why I would like to read that book.", "type": "text"}]}]}